WEBVTT

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:06.390
This has already become a war...

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:09.720
I'm ashamed this happened
in my presence.

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:11.730
The Apostles of the Stars...

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:15.400
That's what Creed Diskenth
called his group?

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.070
Yeah...

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:20.740
To think that he's gained
this much power...

00:00:20.740 --> 00:00:23.740
We have to take action right away.

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:27.080
The assault on the Apostles of the Stars...

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:29.440
would you leave that to me?

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:33.410
I'm not saying I'll do it alone.

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:35.750
We'll take care of it
in one shot as Cerberus.

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:37.090
Jenos...

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:39.750
Nizer's wounds have
already healed as well.

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.760
He probably wants to get payback, too.

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:46.430
I see... Cerberus, huh?

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:49.430
Vengeful thoughts lead to ruin.

00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:51.230
I know.

00:00:52.430 --> 00:00:54.100
Okay...

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:56.830
Jenos, we'll leave it to you.

00:00:58.110 --> 00:00:59.870
I appreciate it.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:06.210
<i>That's how it always starts...</i>
<i>under the azure sky</i>

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:13.380
<i>After making a vow,</i>
<i>I now set off</i>

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:32.510
<i>Yeah, the desert glitters with a golden hue</i>
<i>(The wind is scorching)</i>

00:01:32.510 --> 00:01:38.850
<i>I'm searching for a diamond flower</i>
<i>(I keep on wandering)</i>

00:01:38.850 --> 00:01:45.190
<i>Now, for the first time in my life,</i>

00:01:45.190 --> 00:01:51.530
<i>I live for someone else</i>

00:01:51.530 --> 00:01:58.030
<i>There's something</i>
<i>I wanna protect</i>

00:01:58.030 --> 00:02:04.540
<i>I'll never,</i>
<i>ever lose it again</i>

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:07.540
<i>Resound,</i>
<i>my heartbeat!</i>

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:17.540
<i>A heartbeat smaller and fragile,</i>
<i>but tougher than anyone's.</i>

00:02:39.740 --> 00:02:43.640
With this much money, I don't
have to work for five years!

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:48.450
I'll keep running, running,
running till I'm free!

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:53.420
That won't happen.

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:55.580
Wh- who the hell are you?

00:02:58.090 --> 00:03:01.030
That tattoo is... C- can't be...

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:02.700
That's right.

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:05.790
I've come to bring you bad luck.

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:10.130
"Lying Cat"

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:16.380
Geez, He's got some nerve,
snoring away like that...

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:17.870
Ow!

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:21.380
Shall I take over... driving?

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:23.720
Huh?

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:25.620
<i>"Elementary on Drift Turn"?</i>

00:03:27.050 --> 00:03:30.390
Thanks, but no thanks.

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:34.060
Anyway, the man in that
wanted poster Annette sent us...

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:35.730
What was his name again?

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:40.400
Blum Pullman, wanted for embezzlement.
Eighty thousand gold.

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:42.400
He's a small fry...

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:46.070
We don't have money, so we don't
have the luxury to be picky.

00:03:46.070 --> 00:03:48.170
That's the hard part...

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:53.080
Salmon, cod roe,
pickled plum, dried bonito...

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:55.750
Since we've got a guy who eats a lot,

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:58.480
although it's not like
he's still growing or anything...

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:03.220
Rice ball festival...

00:04:09.030 --> 00:04:11.030
Train...

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:14.700
What shall we do with him, Creed?

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:16.370
Let's see how things go for a while.

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:22.040
Ha! If you let me, I can easily
send a guy like him to kingdom come.

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:26.600
If I wasn't interrupted, I could've
taken care of him in Sangeles City.

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:33.720
You and Train are in different leagues.

00:04:33.720 --> 00:04:35.720
Why are you obsessed
with that damn cat!?

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:38.590
The only gunman you need in
the Apostles of the Stars is me!

00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:49.400
Watch your mouth.

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:52.070
Stop thinking about needless things,

00:04:52.070 --> 00:04:55.510
and just do what I tell you.

00:05:03.020 --> 00:05:05.350
Who cares about Black Cat!?

00:05:05.350 --> 00:05:07.050
Give me a break!

00:05:13.030 --> 00:05:15.030
Did you wait long?

00:05:15.030 --> 00:05:16.700
What happened?

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:19.370
Nothing big...

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:22.370
Be careful, since you're
not young any more.

00:05:22.370 --> 00:05:25.700
That's not nice! I'm still 25.

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:29.330
What do you want,
calling me to a place like this?

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:32.380
What's this?

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:35.380
I'd like to end our contract with you.

00:05:35.380 --> 00:05:37.050
Why!?

00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:39.720
You saw what happened
in Sangeles City, right?

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:42.650
The power of the Apostles of the Stars...

00:05:44.390 --> 00:05:45.720
So what?

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:48.820
If you stay involved in this,
you'll be in danger.

00:05:57.400 --> 00:05:59.840
H- hey...

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:02.340
Oh boy...

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:07.350
I'm not withdrawing,
until I steal Shinkitou from them!

00:06:07.350 --> 00:06:10.020
Rins...

00:06:10.020 --> 00:06:13.020
I knew this job'd be dangerous
from the beginning.

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:16.690
So, I don't mind dying for it.

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:18.360
You win...

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:21.030
Then, the contract stays as is.

00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:24.030
That being the case,
I won't lift a finger to help.

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:26.030
You're on your own to find clues, okay?

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:27.700
I know.

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:31.040
Well, by the time you get
to the Apostles of the Stars,

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:34.040
I think everything
will be resolved, though...

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:37.010
What did he mean!?

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:45.720
What!? You're saying
Blum's already been arrested!?

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:46.720
Yes.

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:48.720
Ow, ow!

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:51.060
But anyway, what're you doing here?

00:06:51.060 --> 00:06:54.390
A lot happened to me, too.
Wanna hear it?

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:55.730
No thanks.

00:06:55.730 --> 00:06:58.400
Oh, okay. How did you get that injury?

00:06:58.400 --> 00:06:59.730
I don't wanna talk about it.

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:02.000
Oh, okay.

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:04.000
You can't put it on your tab today, okay?

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:05.670
Ouch!

00:07:05.670 --> 00:07:08.670
Don't speak with such a pitiful voice.

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:10.680
Hey, whose fault do you
think it is that I got injured!?

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:13.680
So, I'm saying I'm sorry, all right?

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:17.020
--This is on the house!
--Yes!

00:07:17.020 --> 00:07:18.680
Oh... bread crusts again...

00:07:18.680 --> 00:07:22.020
How rude! They're deep-fried this time!

00:07:22.020 --> 00:07:25.690
That's right, Train.
They're deep-fried although they're free.

00:07:25.690 --> 00:07:27.690
That's right, Train.

00:07:27.690 --> 00:07:29.700
Someone's already captured Blum,

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:32.030
and we have to pay for Sven's medicine.

00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:34.700
We can't expect too much.

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:37.040
Whoa! What a sensible daughter you got.

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:39.370
She's not my daughter!

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:44.380
By the way, when and where
was Blum captured, and by whom?

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:47.050
Oh, that was yesterday at this place...

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:49.720
by a sweeper named Black Cat...

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:51.380
Black Cat!?

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:55.050
That's right. I heard that
he's a famous man in the underground.

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:59.390
He's merciless and coldhearted...
and used to be an expert assassin.

00:07:59.390 --> 00:08:01.330
He disappeared 6 months ago,

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:04.000
but made a comeback
as a sweeper recently.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:06.330
He's suspicious, isn't he?

00:08:06.330 --> 00:08:08.330
What does he look like?

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:14.010
Hmm... He's about 40 years old
and very well-fleshed...

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:17.070
That's no black cat, but a fat cat.

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:20.680
Boy, I ate a lot.

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:24.350
Gee, being Black Cat sure is profitable.

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:26.690
Good that I changed
my occupation after all.

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:28.020
Ouch!

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:30.690
I'm sorry.

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:34.290
I can't hear you, pops.

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:40.700
N- no... I'm not wimpy Woodney any more.

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:43.700
I'm Black Cat!

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:46.710
You, bastard! Who do you think I am?

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:47.710
Huh?

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:49.380
This tattoo...

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:52.210
Hmm? Oh, it's not on this one today...

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:57.380
Can't you see this tattoo!?

00:08:57.380 --> 00:09:02.660
I'm very sorry! I didn't have the
slightest idea that you were Black Cat!

00:09:02.660 --> 00:09:06.330
Hey, hey... If you shout like that,
people'll stare at us.

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:09.330
In token of my apology,
I'll take you to a good place!

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:13.330
It's a fine place
with many pretty women...

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:15.430
Really?

00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:19.000
I ate them all...

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:22.680
Princess, could you order
my after-meal milk for me?

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:24.340
Hmm?

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:26.350
Oh? Where's the princess?

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:28.350
She went to a pharmacy.

00:09:28.350 --> 00:09:29.350
A pharmacy?

00:09:29.350 --> 00:09:33.250
She went to buy a salve for my wounds.

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:37.690
You see how kind Eve is?

00:09:37.690 --> 00:09:40.690
Hey, can I have some milk?

00:09:40.690 --> 00:09:43.360
Geez...

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:45.030
So, what're we gonna do?

00:09:45.030 --> 00:09:46.030
About what?

00:09:46.030 --> 00:09:48.700
About that impostor...

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:50.370
Nothing really...

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:53.710
Well, if you say so...

00:09:53.710 --> 00:09:58.670
Seems like there're quite many people
who're still after you, so...

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:07.550
You may be right.

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:14.730
Bring me more food! Bring me drinks!

00:10:14.730 --> 00:10:17.400
I'll capture all the bad guys for you!

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:20.400
Wow! You're so dependable!

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:24.600
Seems like luck has tuned my way.

00:10:32.410 --> 00:10:34.750
So, what kind of wound is it?

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:37.580
Is it a graze wound?
Or is it a cut wound?

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:40.580
He was shot with a gun.

00:10:42.760 --> 00:10:45.760
Th- thanks for shopping.

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:47.490
Hope he gets better soon.

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:07.050
Did you really meet Black Cat?

00:11:07.050 --> 00:11:08.050
Yes!

00:11:08.050 --> 00:11:10.380
If it was a lie, you'll be sorry.

00:11:10.380 --> 00:11:14.720
It's true! I took him into
"Quick-draw Tavern", on the main avenue.

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:19.390
Ha! If we take down Black Cat,
we'll become famous.

00:11:19.390 --> 00:11:22.790
Shall we ambush him
right outside the tavern?

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:25.730
See you later, then!

00:11:25.730 --> 00:11:28.730
Make sure you
come back now, Black Cat!

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:31.740
You have to!

00:11:31.740 --> 00:11:34.170
I'm so happy it's scary!

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:45.420
Don't stare at me like that, señorita.

00:11:45.420 --> 00:11:47.750
If you fall in love with me,
you'll get burned.

00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:50.420
Just kidding.

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:54.090
You're the Black Cat?

00:11:54.090 --> 00:11:56.090
So you found that out?

00:11:56.090 --> 00:11:58.430
Wanna see my tattoo?

00:11:58.430 --> 00:12:01.370
Mister, someone's after you.

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:05.370
Don't call me Mister, señorita.
At least call me big brother.

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:09.040
Oh... after me, you said? Who?

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:11.040
A man who looks like this...

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:15.050
was talking with scary-looking people
about attacking you.

00:12:15.050 --> 00:12:17.720
So, you'd better run.

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:21.720
D- don't be silly. I'm Black Cat.

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:25.020
I take out guys like
that with my Haadysu...

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:29.730
Well, then, señorita...

00:12:29.730 --> 00:12:31.290
Oops...

00:12:35.070 --> 00:12:38.500
So, you're Black Cat?

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:55.750
Hey, one guy vs. three...

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:57.420
He has no chance of winning...

00:12:57.420 --> 00:13:02.360
The six o'clock bell will
be the signal for the match.

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:04.460
Y- yeah...

00:13:15.710 --> 00:13:18.270
I'm... actually...

00:13:25.380 --> 00:13:28.390
♪ Wading through a storm of bullets, ♪

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:31.390
♪ He's wandered,
wandered to the farthest land, ♪

00:13:31.390 --> 00:13:37.400
♪ Oh, he's a sorrowful, stray gunman. ♪

00:13:37.400 --> 00:13:39.390
♪ Ba-da-ba-da-boom! ♪

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:43.070
Hey, miss... what did you come
to a country town like this for?

00:13:43.070 --> 00:13:45.400
I'm meeting my friend!

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:47.770
Meeting a guy? I'm jealous.

00:13:49.740 --> 00:13:52.080
Touch me and you die.

00:13:52.080 --> 00:13:53.980
Y- yes, ma'am.

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:05.690
Now, let's eat to our heart's content!

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:08.890
At any rate, this is a cerebration
for my escaping death...

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:12.030
no, for my winning the duel.

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:15.370
But still, taking down
three people in one instant...

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:19.040
I'm so strong it's almost scary...

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:21.370
Wh- what the?

00:14:21.370 --> 00:14:22.710
Hmm?

00:14:31.380 --> 00:14:34.390
Still, I wonder when I shot them...

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:37.390
Oh, it's already this late...

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:41.390
Señorita, where's your house!?
I'll walk you home.

00:14:41.390 --> 00:14:45.060
--I don't have one.
--What? What about your parents?

00:14:45.060 --> 00:14:46.730
I don't have any.

00:14:46.730 --> 00:14:48.730
An orphan!

00:14:48.730 --> 00:14:51.740
You're like me!

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:55.410
I see, I see... You're cute but you've
been living a tough life, haven't you?

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:56.740
Not really...

00:14:56.740 --> 00:14:59.080
Don't worry, you don't have to pretend.

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:03.850
Because I've been living
all alone in this world, too.

00:15:05.350 --> 00:15:09.350
I'm a respectable sweeper now,

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:13.360
but before, people made fun of me,
calling me wimpy Woodney...

00:15:13.360 --> 00:15:16.360
I really had a tough...

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:19.030
I know! I'll be your big brother!

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:22.370
If we travel together,
you won't be lonely, right!?

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:23.370
No thanks.

00:15:23.370 --> 00:15:24.700
Why?

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:27.730
If you're with Black Cat,
there's nothing to be scared of!

00:15:37.380 --> 00:15:40.720
Why in the heck're you
eating bread crusts in a tavern!?

00:15:40.720 --> 00:15:43.720
We did deep-fry them!

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:45.060
What's going on?

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:49.150
I can't help it. Things didn't go as planed.

00:15:52.730 --> 00:15:53.730
What?

00:15:53.730 --> 00:15:55.070
Time to work!

00:15:55.070 --> 00:15:56.070
Work?

00:15:56.070 --> 00:16:00.070
Did you forget!? You're still
employed by me, aren't you?

00:16:00.070 --> 00:16:01.670
Employed?

00:16:01.670 --> 00:16:03.680
Shinkitou, okay!? Shinkitou!!

00:16:03.680 --> 00:16:06.340
What!? You haven't given up yet?

00:16:06.340 --> 00:16:09.680
Of course not! We'll find
the Apostles of the Stars' hideout

00:16:09.680 --> 00:16:12.680
and steal it!

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:15.350
Is it okay to leave those two there?

00:16:15.350 --> 00:16:19.690
Yeah. I think it'll be all right since I left
a note for them to wait for me there.

00:16:19.690 --> 00:16:24.700
Also, I don't want to involve
Train and Eve in this.

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:29.400
I particularly don't want Train to
get closer to the Apostles of the Stars.

00:16:43.050 --> 00:16:44.720
Ouch...

00:16:44.720 --> 00:16:46.380
What happened?

00:16:46.380 --> 00:16:48.380
I don't know...

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:51.310
You...

00:16:53.060 --> 00:16:55.930
Where did Black Cat go?

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:06.000
I see, you chose to
live alone, too, señorita.

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:10.340
If you're that determined about it,
I won't ask any more.

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:17.350
Well, it may be hard for you, señorita,
to live with a dangerous man like me.

00:17:17.350 --> 00:17:22.350
Mister, I'm surprised to see
you've been able to live this long.

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:24.360
That's because I'm extremely perceptive.

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:26.360
I reflectively dodge attacks,

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:30.030
and shoot up the enemy
with bullets from Haaydsu.

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:31.700
How should I put it...

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:35.370
My body instinctively knows offence
and defense, or, something like that...

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:37.070
Well, even if I explain it,

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:40.900
it's probably hard for an amateur
to understand the mind-set of an expert...

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:43.710
Duck, Mister!

00:17:43.710 --> 00:17:44.800
Hm?

00:17:52.720 --> 00:17:57.660
If I remember correctly,
you're Black Cat's friend, aren't you?

00:17:59.060 --> 00:18:02.790
Now, tell me! Where's Black Cat!?

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:08.260
If you don't tell me now...

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:11.370
Hold it!

00:18:13.670 --> 00:18:15.670
Who the hell're you?

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:21.680
I... I'm... u- uhm... Bla... Bla... Bla...

00:18:21.680 --> 00:18:24.350
Enough blabbering, just beat it already!

00:18:24.350 --> 00:18:26.690
Th- that's not it!

00:18:26.690 --> 00:18:28.350
Mister...

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:33.020
D- don't worry, señorita.

00:18:33.020 --> 00:18:36.050
Y- you've got Black Cat with you.

00:18:37.030 --> 00:18:41.370
Come on! Pull yourself together!

00:18:41.370 --> 00:18:45.460
I'm the only one who can
protect this señorita!

00:18:46.710 --> 00:18:50.710
Now! If you can,
go ahead and shoot me!

00:18:50.710 --> 00:18:53.710
B- before you shoot,

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:57.050
my Haadysu'll emit fire!

00:18:58.720 --> 00:19:01.990
I am... the world-renowned...

00:19:01.990 --> 00:19:03.320
Black Cat!!

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:05.320
♪ White milk and red milk. ♪

00:19:05.320 --> 00:19:07.850
♪ Yellow milk is, oh so bad! ♪

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:13.300
♪ Oh yeah, it's our milk festival! ♪

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:15.960
Hmm?

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:18.670
Hey, princess!

00:19:18.670 --> 00:19:21.340
What're you doing in a place like this?

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:23.340
Black Cat!!

00:19:23.340 --> 00:19:25.680
Hmm?

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:28.010
You're...

00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:29.280
that guy from!

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:47.370
It's no use waiting
for my bullets to run out.

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:52.500
This is a "spirit bullet" that I put
my "spirit" into through this gun.

00:19:55.370 --> 00:19:58.470
Then, how about this?

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:25.090
Are you here on Creed's orders?

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:38.080
Get lost!

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:41.850
The only one I'm after is Creed.

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:49.090
You and Train are in different leagues.

00:20:49.090 --> 00:20:50.930
Dammit!

00:20:54.430 --> 00:20:56.770
What!? You brought me along
just for the heck of it!?

00:20:56.770 --> 00:20:58.100
Of course!

00:20:58.100 --> 00:21:00.410
There's no way that I'd know where
the Apostles of the Stars' hideout is,

00:21:00.410 --> 00:21:01.370
I tell you!

00:21:01.370 --> 00:21:05.380
Geez... give me a break...

00:21:05.380 --> 00:21:08.380
Where are we?

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:09.870
Oh?

00:21:11.380 --> 00:21:14.390
What the heck're you doing
in a place like this?

00:21:14.390 --> 00:21:16.010
Nothing big...

00:21:25.400 --> 00:21:30.070
Gee, you sure come up
with cruel ideas...

00:21:30.070 --> 00:21:34.410
We'll have him guide us to
the Apostles of the Stars' hideout.

00:21:34.410 --> 00:21:36.310
It's a good idea, don't you think?

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:41.080
So, who might this be?

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:44.750
Mister said that he wants
to be Train's disciple.

00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:49.090
That's not nice, Miss. You can
stop calling me Mister now.

00:21:49.090 --> 00:21:51.420
I'm still twenty years old!

00:21:51.420 --> 00:21:53.150
--Twenty!?
--Twenty!?
--Twenty!?

00:21:54.760 --> 00:21:57.820
He doesn't look like he's twenty,
don't you think, Train?

00:22:02.030 --> 00:22:03.500
Train...

00:22:11.680 --> 00:22:16.650
<i>The stars in the night sky</i>
<i>are my tears</i>

00:22:16.650 --> 00:22:20.650
<i>Goddess of the moon,</i>
<i>angel of the stars!</i>

00:22:20.650 --> 00:22:26.420
<i>Please stop time tonight!</i>

00:22:35.330 --> 00:22:41.340
<i>Please show yourself,</i>
<i>even if just a little</i>

00:22:41.340 --> 00:22:44.270
<i>Around the time</i>
<i>the first evening star appears,</i>

00:22:44.270 --> 00:22:47.110
<i>I hear footsteps approaching</i>

00:22:47.110 --> 00:22:53.020
<i>The only time I can see you</i>
<i>is when the moon is shining</i>

00:22:53.020 --> 00:22:56.020
<i>Please let me dream a little</i>

00:22:56.020 --> 00:22:59.260
<i>'Cause it'll become</i>
<i>an illusion by morning</i>

00:22:59.260 --> 00:23:02.630
<i>Even though I know it,</i>
<i>I still feel lonely</i>

00:23:02.630 --> 00:23:08.300
<i>The stars in the night sky</i>
<i>are my tears</i>

00:23:08.300 --> 00:23:14.300
<i>You held me in your arms</i>
<i>and your passionate lips met mine</i>

00:23:14.300 --> 00:23:17.310
<i>Please don't let go of me</i>

00:23:17.310 --> 00:23:20.640
<i>I'm about to melt in your arms</i>

00:23:20.640 --> 00:23:23.480
<i>But morning is almost here</i>

00:23:23.480 --> 00:23:26.980
<i>Goddess of the moon,</i>
<i>angel of the stars!</i>

00:23:26.980 --> 00:23:33.320
<i>I pray to you,</i>
<i>please stop time</i>

00:23:40.730 --> 00:23:42.400
"Next Episode"

00:23:42.400 --> 00:23:47.070
<i>I'm the seventh member</i>
<i>of Chrono Numbers, Jenos Hazard.</i>

00:23:47.070 --> 00:23:51.070
<i>I'm usually elegant,</i>
<i>but right now it's different.</i>

00:23:51.070 --> 00:23:54.410
<i>With my own hands, I'll crush</i>
<i>the Apostles of the Stars</i>

00:23:54.410 --> 00:23:56.410
<i>who ruined my pride.</i>

00:23:56.410 --> 00:23:58.750
<i>Nizer! Beluga!</i>

00:23:58.750 --> 00:24:01.480
<i>Let's show Creed the</i>
<i>boundless power of Cerberus,</i>

00:24:01.480 --> 00:24:02.690
<i>an assault force that</i>
<i>knocks down all in its path!</i>

00:24:02.690 --> 00:24:05.260
"Fighting Cat"
<i>an assault force that</i>
<i>knocks down all in its path!</i>

00:24:05.260 --> 00:24:05.650
"Fighting Cat"
